msgstr "Não conseguimos cobrar seu cartão"

#. translators: %s: number of days remaining
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1272
#, php-format
msgid "Update your payment method within %s day to keep Pro. Your images keep being delivered optimized in the meantime."
msgid_plural "Update your payment method within %s days to keep Pro. Your images keep being delivered optimized in the meantime."
msgstr[0] "Atualize sua forma de pagamento em %s dia para manter o Pro. Suas imagens continuam sendo entregues otimizadas enquanto isso."
msgstr[1] "Atualize sua forma de pagamento em %s dias para manter o Pro. Suas imagens continuam sendo entregues otimizadas enquanto isso."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1276
msgid "Update your payment method today to keep Pro. Your images keep being delivered optimized in the meantime."
msgstr "Atualize sua forma de pagamento hoje para manter o Pro. Suas imagens continuam sendo entregues otimizadas enquanto isso."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1280
msgid "Update payment method"
msgstr "Atualizar forma de pagamento"

#. translators: %s: percentage, for example "88%"
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1314
#, php-format
msgid "Home page %s lighter · measured"
msgstr "Página inicial %s mais leve · medido"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1317
msgid "Measured on the first visit to your home page."
msgstr "Medimos na primeira visita à sua página inicial."

#. translators: %s: percentage, for example "91%"
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1331
#, php-format
msgid "%s of your images are served from our cache, not from your server."
msgstr "%s das suas imagens saem do nosso cache, não do seu servidor."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1334
msgid "Each image leaves your server once; after that, our cache serves it."
msgstr "Cada imagem sai do seu servidor uma única vez; depois, quem entrega é o nosso cache."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1341
msgid "Why NimboCDN"
msgstr "Por que o NimboCDN"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1344
msgid "Every visitor gets smaller images, in the best format their browser accepts, delivered by our global network. Your WordPress stays exactly as it is."
msgstr "Cada visitante recebe imagens menores, no melhor formato que o navegador dele aceita, entregues pela nossa rede global. Seu WordPress continua exatamente igual."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1349
msgid "Faster site"
msgstr "Site mais rápido"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1353
msgid "Lighter server"
msgstr "Servidor mais leve"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1404
msgid "Pro active · your whole site optimized"
msgstr "Pro ativo · o site inteiro otimizado"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1409
msgid "Free"
msgstr "Gratuito"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1409
msgid "Your home page optimized, for good"
msgstr "Sua página inicial otimizada, para sempre"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1410
msgid "Pro"
msgstr "Pro"

#. translators: %s: number of images
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1441
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:3227
#, php-format
msgid "%s image outside your home page still reaches your visitors heavy."
msgid_plural "%s images outside your home page still reach your visitors heavy."
msgstr[0] "%s imagem fora da página inicial ainda chega pesada aos seus visitantes."
msgstr[1] "%s imagens fora da página inicial ainda chegam pesadas aos seus visitantes."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1445
msgid "With Pro, all of them would be optimized."
msgstr "Com o Pro, todas seriam otimizadas."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1451
msgid "See Pro ↓"
msgstr "Ver o Pro ↓"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1551
msgid "Our global network"
msgstr "Nossa rede global"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1554
msgid "World map with our data centers and the one serving this computer"
msgstr "Mapa-múndi com nossos data centers e o que atende este computador"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1562
msgid "Finding where your images are delivered from…"
msgstr "Localizando de onde vêm suas imagens…"

#. translators: 1: number of cities, 2: number of countries
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1568
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s cities in more than %2$s countries deliver your images."
msgstr "%1$s cidades em mais de %2$s países entregam suas imagens."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1574
msgid "Approximate location from the IP address of this computer. Nothing is stored: it is shown and discarded."
msgstr "Localização aproximada pelo IP deste computador. Nada é guardado: aparece na tela e é descartado."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1589
msgid "Talk to us"
msgstr "Fale com a gente"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1592
msgid "A question, a problem, an idea — write and a person answers."
msgstr "Uma dúvida, um problema, uma ideia — escreva e uma pessoa responde."

#. translators: %s: the "Settings → NimboCDN" menu path, linked to this screen
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1603
#, php-format
msgid "This screen always lives under %s."
msgstr "Esta tela fica sempre em %s."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:1604
msgid "Settings → NimboCDN"
msgstr "Configurações → NimboCDN"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2135
msgid "Optimization paused"
msgstr "Otimização pausada"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2141
msgid "Delivering optimized images"
msgstr "Imagens otimizadas no ar"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2144
msgid "New images not optimized"
msgstr "Imagens novas sem otimização"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2149
msgid "Could not measure"
msgstr "Não foi possível medir"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2152
msgid "Not measured yet"
msgstr "Ainda não medido"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2207
msgid "In the last 30 days your visitors received each image"
msgstr "Nos últimos 30 dias, seus visitantes receberam cada imagem"

#. translators: %s: amount of data, for example "1.8 GB"
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2221
#, php-format
msgid "That is %s they did not have to download"
msgstr "São %s que eles não precisaram baixar"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2228
msgid "of images — no saving measured yet against what WordPress would have served."
msgstr "de imagens — ainda não há economia medida em relação ao que o WordPress teria entregue."

#. translators: %s: amount of data, for example "12.4 GB"
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2234
#, php-format
msgid "Since you installed NimboCDN: %s less."
msgstr "Desde que você instalou o NimboCDN: %s a menos."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2262
msgid "Measuring your home page…"
msgstr "Medindo sua página inicial…"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2291
msgid "Each image on your home page is now"
msgstr "Cada imagem da sua página inicial está agora"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2301
msgid "As soon as the first visits arrive, this number updates with them."
msgstr "Assim que chegarem as primeiras visitas, este número se atualiza com elas."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2331
msgid "This is running in the background and can take up to a minute. This screen refreshes on its own — nothing to press."
msgstr "Isso está rodando em segundo plano e pode levar até um minuto. Esta tela se atualiza sozinha — não precisa clicar em nada."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2346
msgid "Step 1 of 4 — connecting this site to the service."
msgstr "Etapa 1 de 4 — conectando este site ao serviço."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2349
msgid "Step 1 of 4 — reading your home page and finding its images."
msgstr "Etapa 1 de 4 — lendo sua página inicial e encontrando as imagens."

#. translators: %s: number of images
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2353
#, php-format
msgid "Step 2 of 4 — registering %s images with the service."
msgstr "Etapa 2 de 4 — registrando %s imagens no serviço."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2356
msgid "Step 2 of 4 — reading the home page again, now optimized."
msgstr "Etapa 2 de 4 — lendo a página inicial de novo, agora otimizada."

#. translators: 1: images weighed so far, 2: images to weigh
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2360
#, php-format
msgid "Step 3 of 4 — weighing the images: %1$s of %2$s."
msgstr "Etapa 3 de 4 — pesando as imagens: %1$s de %2$s."

#. translators: 1: images weighed so far, 2: images to weigh, 3: attempt number, 4: attempts
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2364
#, php-format
msgid "Step 3 of 4 — %1$s of %2$s weighed; waiting for the network to learn the new list (attempt %3$s of %4$s)."
msgstr "Etapa 3 de 4 — %1$s de %2$s pesadas; esperando a rede aprender a lista nova (tentativa %3$s de %4$s)."

#. translators: 1: images weighed so far, 2: images to weigh
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2368
#, php-format
msgid "Step 3 of 4 — %1$s of %2$s weighed; one more try for the rest."
msgstr "Etapa 3 de 4 — %1$s de %2$s pesadas; mais uma tentativa para as demais."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2371
msgid "Step 4 of 4 — second pass, from the cache, to measure the response time."
msgstr "Etapa 4 de 4 — segunda passada, do cache, para medir o tempo de resposta."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2374
msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "Começando…"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2431
msgid "images delivered"
msgstr "imagens entregues"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2433
msgid "Images delivered by NimboCDN in the latest measurement of your home page. Visitor traffic takes over as it arrives."
msgstr "Imagens entregues pelo NimboCDN na última medição da sua página inicial. O tráfego de visitantes assume conforme chega."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2434
msgid "Images NimboCDN delivered to your visitors in the last 30 days."
msgstr "Imagens que o NimboCDN entregou aos seus visitantes nos últimos 30 dias."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2441
msgid "delivered by our network"
msgstr "entregues pela nossa rede"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2443
msgid "What NimboCDN delivered while weighing your home page. Visitor traffic takes over as it arrives."
msgstr "O que o NimboCDN entregou ao pesar a sua página inicial. O tráfego de visitantes assume assim que chegar."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2444
msgid "Everything NimboCDN sent to your visitors in the last 30 days. Your own server did not have to send any of it."
msgstr "Tudo o que o NimboCDN enviou aos seus visitantes nos últimos 30 dias. O seu servidor não precisou enviar nada disso."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2452
msgid "without touching your server"
msgstr "sem tocar no seu servidor"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2455
msgid "Shown once enough images have been delivered: on the first day almost everything is a first request."
msgstr "Aparece quando houver imagens suficientes entregues: no primeiro dia quase tudo é uma primeira solicitação."

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2474
msgid "network response time"
msgstr "resposta da rede"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2534
msgid "Format your visitors received"
msgstr "Formato que seus visitantes receberam"

#. translators: 1: format name, 2: number of images, 3: percentage
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2544
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: %2$s images (%3$s)"
msgstr "%1$s: %2$s imagens (%3$s)"

#. translators: 1: date, 2: amount of data, for example "1.8 MB"
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2595
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: %2$s less"
msgstr "%1$s: %2$s a menos"

#. translators: %s: date
#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2597
#, php-format
msgid "%s: no saving recorded"
msgstr "%s: nenhuma economia registrada"

#: includes/class-nimbocdn-settings.php:2618
msgid "Last 30 days — fills in with the first visits"
msgstr "Últimos 30 dias — preenche com as primeiras visitas"

